   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/e0b6a542aa3894ac.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work by C. F. Draper, et al./<i>Scientific Reports</i>, under CC BY 4.0 license)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n",
   "stem_html": "<p>The graph shows the hormone levels for the four main hormones in an idealized menstrual cycle.</p>\n<p>In this graph, what is the dependent variable?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1070285,
     "content_html": "Time."
    },
    {
     "id": 1070286,
     "content_html": "The phase of the menstrual cycle."
    },
    {
     "id": 1070287,
     "content_html": "Hormone levels."
    },
    {
     "id": 1070288,
     "content_html": "The length of the cycle."
